WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:0
Each side has 25 pieces; you see only your own.
Capture the enemy flag or block every move to win.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:18.000 line:0
Deploy first: tap two of your pieces to swap them,
or choose a preset or Auto.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000 line:0
Confirming is final; when the opponent confirms,
you only see that they are ready.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:34.000 line:0
Fast-forward: East confirms too, then both sides
move in turn and the armies close in.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.500 line:0
Select one of your pieces, then the enemy to attack.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:44.999 line:0
The attack wins and the enemy piece is removed;
the referee reports only the result, never the rank.

00:00:44.999 --> 00:00:58.999 line:0
Fast-forward: both sides manoeuvre and fight;
enemy ranks stay hidden.

00:00:58.999 --> 00:01:07.999 line:0
Both flags are now public; North’s piece sits beside
East’s flag and attacks the headquarters.

00:01:07.999 --> 00:01:17.000 line:0
North takes the flag and wins.
Only now are all remaining ranks revealed.
